===Etymology===
{{compound|dish|washer|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈdɪʃˌwɒʃə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈdɪʃˌwɑʃɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|Dishwasher US.ogg|Audio (U.S.A.)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[machine]] for washing dishes.
# Someone who washes dishes, especially one [[hired]] to wash dishes in a [[restaurant]].
# {{context|UK|dialect|Wiltshire|lang=en}} A [[European]] [[bird]], the [[wagtail]].

